# Fixture files are recorded byte for byte: an expected.json stores byte spans into the source
# beside it, and a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise add a \r before every
# \n and shift every span after the first line ending. Keep them LF on every platform.
fixtures/**            text eol=lf
crates/*/fixtures/**   text eol=lf

# Engine output and images are never text, whatever their extension suggests to Git.
*.gz                   binary
*.pdf                  binary
*.png                  binary
